cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "graphiti-lens"
abstract: >-
  A read-only explorer for the Graphiti temporal knowledge graph: bitemporal edges,
  episodes and entities rendered in a local web view, opened by default through a
  one-time access link, because nothing off-the-shelf understands Graphiti's bitemporal
  model.
